# Tells git how to treat files in this repository.
# "text=auto eol=lf": git detects text files and always stores them with LF
# line endings, no matter which operating system a teammate uses.
# This prevents fake "every line changed" diffs between Windows and Mac/Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their contents.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
